Jordan,

Interface spec v4.2 attached (MES_Tessera_Interface_v4.2.pdf) and the station map. Summary of changes:

- station IDs unchanged (L3-ST01 through L3-ST14)
- event payload gains two fields: operator_id, cycle_count
- event types unchanged (CYCLE_START, CYCLE_END, HOLD, RESUME)

Sample events (12) from the staging MES are in the zip. Excerpt from the staging log:

  2026-03-24 11:02:11 L3-ST07 CYCLE_END   order=HB-88123 cycle=412 operator=OP-2291
  2026-03-24 11:02:19 L3-ST08 CYCLE_START order=HB-88123 operator=OP-2291

Window confirmed for Wednesday 18:00–22:00 PT. I will be on the bridge; details are in the calendar invite.

